{
    "title": "SIXT rent. share. ride. plus.",
    "description": "Sixt offers car rentals in over 100 countries, flexible carsharing just around the corner, and ridehailing worldwide.    \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">DIGITAL CAR RENTAL</font></b> \r\n\r\nSkip the counter! Open your car directly with our App and enjoy the ride.   \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">CARSHARING WITH NO LIMITS</font></b> \r\n\r\nNo limits for cars, duration and drop-off points - also at any SIXT station.  \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">WORLDWIDE RIDEHAILING</font></b> \r\n\r\nConvenient ride hailing, taxi and limousine services wherever you need them. \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">SIXT rent - Car rental:</font></b> \r\n\r\nWith the SIXT App, you can book a rental car in just a few seconds! Get access to all our car rental offers, find information about the nearest stations and how to get to them, select and reserve your desired car, and stay signed into your SIXT account to manage all reservations even faster. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Are you planning a trip with friends and need to rent a car with a lot of cargo space and more than five seats? Find the perfect car with the SIXT App. Use our filters to select a vehicle that suits your needs. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Filter by car type (minivan, coupe, automatic, truck), equipment, number of seats, and driver age \r\n\r\n\u2022 Sort by price or popularity \r\n\r\n\u2022 Manage multiple profiles with just one login \r\n\r\n\u2022 Book with your SIXT Express and SIXT Corporate rates and preconditions \r\n\r\n\u2022 Find information about each of our more than 2,200 stations \r\n\r\n\u2022 Customize every reservation with the extras and protections that let you feel safe  \r\n\r\n\u2022 Easily navigate to the station using the App or our detailed written directions \r\n\r\n\u2022 Details about every car category help you decide which one is right for you \r\n\r\n\u2022 View the details of your upcoming reservation or your current rental \r\n\r\n\u2022 See an overview of your reservation history \r\n\r\n\u2022 Manage and update your account data all in one place \r\n\r\n<b>Top car rental locations in USA</b> \r\n\r\nCar rental Atlanta, car rental California, car rental Dallas, car rental Denver, car rental Florida, car rental Fort Lauderdale, car rental Fort Myers, car rental Indianapolis, car rental Las Vegas, car rental Los Angeles, car rental Miami, car rental Miami Beach, car rental Minneapolis, car rental Orlando, car rental Philadelphia, car rental Phoenix, car rental San Antonio, car rental San Diego, car rental San Francisco, car rental San Jose, car rental Seattle, car rental Tampa, car rental West Palm Beach. \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sixt.com%2Fcar-rental%2Fusa&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0HDtnAMTnZcY1RcKFCfLu9\">All US Locations </a> \r\n \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">SIXT share - Car sharing (Germany & Netherlands!):</font></b> \r\n\r\n\u2022 Always the right vehicle thanks to our large SIXT fleet \r\n\r\n\u2022 Return at SIXT stations country-wide possible \r\n\r\n\u2022 Flexible rental from one minute up to 27 days  \r\n\r\n\u2022 Best price guarantee thanks to our intelligent pricing  \r\n\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">SIXT ride - Ride, taxi, cabs and chauffeur services:</font></b> \r\n\r\nChoose SIXT ride to book a car with your very own driver. Hop in, sit back, relax, and enjoy the ride with one of our local, professional drivers.  \r\n\r\n\u2022 Book your ride on demand or in advance in only a few minutes and track your driver live in the App to know when your driver will arrive. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Pay easily and securely with your credit card for taxi on demand rides or any pre-scheduled ride \u2013 no need for cash. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Choose between our range of car classes from economy to first class. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Arriving by plane? Your driver will track your flight for delays to make sure they greet you in the arrival's hall for your actual landing time to help you with your luggage. \r\n\r\n\u2022 You can make use of our service to get to and from conferences and trade shows, as well as hourly bookings for shopping and city tours.  \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Contact</b> \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sixt.com%2Fapp%2F&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw39eqKD9ptWk3cNMbGG0rcb\"><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\"> https://www.sixt.com/app/</font></b></a> \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">Phone:</font></b> +1 888 SIXT CAR (749 8227) \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">E-Mail:</font></b> reservations-usa@sixt.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Sixt offers car rentals in over 100 countries, flexible carsharing just around the corner, and ridehailing worldwide.    <br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">DIGITAL CAR RENTAL</font></b> <br><br>Skip the counter! Open your car directly with our App and enjoy the ride.   <br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">CARSHARING WITH NO LIMITS</font></b> <br><br>No limits for cars, duration and drop-off points - also at any SIXT station.  <br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">WORLDWIDE RIDEHAILING</font></b> <br><br>Convenient ride hailing, taxi and limousine services wherever you need them. <br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">SIXT rent - Car rental:</font></b> <br><br>With the SIXT App, you can book a rental car in just a few seconds! Get access to all our car rental offers, find information about the nearest stations and how to get to them, select and reserve your desired car, and stay signed into your SIXT account to manage all reservations even faster. <br><br>\u2022 Are you planning a trip with friends and need to rent a car with a lot of cargo space and more than five seats? Find the perfect car with the SIXT App. Use our filters to select a vehicle that suits your needs. <br><br>\u2022 Filter by car type (minivan, coupe, automatic, truck), equipment, number of seats, and driver age <br><br>\u2022 Sort by price or popularity <br><br>\u2022 Manage multiple profiles with just one login <br><br>\u2022 Book with your SIXT Express and SIXT Corporate rates and preconditions <br><br>\u2022 Find information about each of our more than 2,200 stations <br><br>\u2022 Customize every reservation with the extras and protections that let you feel safe  <br><br>\u2022 Easily navigate to the station using the App or our detailed written directions <br><br>\u2022 Details about every car category help you decide which one is right for you <br><br>\u2022 View the details of your upcoming reservation or your current rental <br><br>\u2022 See an overview of your reservation history <br><br>\u2022 Manage and update your account data all in one place <br><br><b>Top car rental locations in USA</b> <br><br>Car rental Atlanta, car rental California, car rental Dallas, car rental Denver, car rental Florida, car rental Fort Lauderdale, car rental Fort Myers, car rental Indianapolis, car rental Las Vegas, car rental Los Angeles, car rental Miami, car rental Miami Beach, car rental Minneapolis, car rental Orlando, car rental Philadelphia, car rental Phoenix, car rental San Antonio, car rental San Diego, car rental San Francisco, car rental San Jose, car rental Seattle, car rental Tampa, car rental West Palm Beach. <br><br><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sixt.com%2Fcar-rental%2Fusa&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw0HDtnAMTnZcY1RcKFCfLu9\">All US Locations </a> <br> <br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">SIXT share - Car sharing (Germany &amp; Netherlands!):</font></b> <br><br>\u2022 Always the right vehicle thanks to our large SIXT fleet <br><br>\u2022 Return at SIXT stations country-wide possible <br><br>\u2022 Flexible rental from one minute up to 27 days  <br><br>\u2022 Best price guarantee thanks to our intelligent pricing  <br><br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">SIXT ride - Ride, taxi, cabs and chauffeur services:</font></b> <br><br>Choose SIXT ride to book a car with your very own driver. Hop in, sit back, relax, and enjoy the ride with one of our local, professional drivers.  <br><br>\u2022 Book your ride on demand or in advance in only a few minutes and track your driver live in the App to know when your driver will arrive. <br><br>\u2022 Pay easily and securely with your credit card for taxi on demand rides or any pre-scheduled ride \u2013 no need for cash. <br><br>\u2022 Choose between our range of car classes from economy to first class. <br><br>\u2022 Arriving by plane? Your driver will track your flight for delays to make sure they greet you in the arrival&#39;s hall for your actual landing time to help you with your luggage. <br><br>\u2022 You can make use of our service to get to and from conferences and trade shows, as well as hourly bookings for shopping and city tours.  <br><br><br><b>Contact</b> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sixt.com%2Fapp%2F&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw39eqKD9ptWk3cNMbGG0rcb\"><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\"> https://www.sixt.com/app/</font></b></a> <br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">Phone:</font></b> +1 888 SIXT CAR (749 8227) <br><br><b><font color=\"#ff5f00\">E-Mail:</font></b> reservations-usa@sixt.com",
